# The graveyard cast needs six counters "from among creatures you control" (CR 118.3: a cost can't be paid without the resources to
# pay it fully). Same game as the one that casts it with exactly six, except that the Memnite stays home on turn 3: Bot2's Weakness
# makes the first Greatwurm a 5/6, it deals 5 and gets five counters, and the second Greatwurm - discarded by Bot2's Mind Twist - can't
# be cast on turn 5 though Black Lotus #2 and four Moxen pay for all {4}{G}{G}. The Memnite never dealt damage, so it has no counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Quilled Greatwurm
Memnite
Quilled Greatwurm
Mox Pearl
Black Lotus
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Weakness
Mind Twist
Island x20

